
                       geant4-11-03-ref-05
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Extended UI command "/geometry/test/run" to support optional overlap check
   mode to check for overlaps in the volume tree without duplication in
   identical logical volumes.
 o Reorganisation of initialisation and data destruction in
   G4LivermorePhotoElectricModel.
 o Added UI command to enable/disable 5D pair production model by muons.
 o In G4Scintillation and G4Cerenkov, build the integral tables only for
   materials that have non-empty material property tables.
 o In G4OpenGLQtViewer, fixed the original pick feature, which was
   inadvertently broken, to show pick info window.
 o Updated zlib to version 1.3.1.
 o Set default configuration to use Qt6 when selecting Qt support.
   User must set GEANT4_USE_QT_QT5 to force find/use of Qt5.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

cmake                                            cmake-V11-03-04
-----
- Set default configuration to use Qt6 when selecting Qt support.
  User must set GEANT4_USE_QT_QT5 to force find/use of Qt5.

config                                           config-V11-03-00
------
- Updated system scripts for Qt settings: set Qt6 as default.

analysis                                         analysis-V11-03-03
--------
- New implementation of generic 'G4Analysis::GetHnType()' and 'IsProfile()'
  functions, which do not rely on the histogram/profile name position in the
  long type name provided via tools 's_class()'.

externals/zlib                                   zlib-V11-03-01
--------------
- Updated zlib to version 1.3.1. Prior Geant4 patches are retained.

geometry/navigation                              geomnav-V11-03-01
-------------------
- Extended UI command "/geometry/test/run" to support optional overlap check
  mode: depending on the selected mode, it invokes either 'TestRecursiveOverlap'
  (default) or 'TestOverlapInTree', allowing to check for overlaps in the
  volume tree without duplication in identical logical volumes.
- Reorganised and enriched comments in headers to follow Doxygen style.
- Removed declared but not implemented methods in G4VoxelNavigation,
  G4ParameterisedNavigation, G4VoxelSafety and G4PathFinder.

geometry/volumes                                 geomvol-V11-03-01
