    transformed into KS or KL.
- models/coherent_elastic (hadr-cohe-V11-03-03)
  o G4ChargeExchange, G4HadronElastic: cleanup final state generation; use
    the numerical limit for argument of the exponent to avoid precision loss;
    in case of numerical problems force scattering angle to zero (do not
    consider scattering backwards); use similar parameterisation and code for
    both models. Fixed reported Coverity defect.
- models/de_excitation (hadr-deex-V11-03-11)
  o G4DeexPrecoUtility: new class, providing the same computation to avoid
    code duplication. Use it in classes G4EvaporationProbability,
    G4ProtonEvaporationProbability, G4DeuteronEvaporationProbability,
    G4TritonEvaporationProbability, G4He3EvaporationProbability and
    G4AlphaEvaporationProbability, simplifying code.
  o G4DeexPrecoParameters: use conservative set of parameters.
  o G4VEmissionProbability: updated parameters of integration of the
    probability density function.
  o G4CoulombBarrier: some code cleanup.
  o G4VFermiFragmentAN, G4FermiBreakUpAN: fixed reported Coverity defects.
- models/inclxx (hadr-inclxx-V11-03-01)
